				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				27,
				13
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across all 13 Element submodules (Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Vine, Wind) synchronizing with upstream revisions.\n\nKey changes:\n- Maintain applies consistent formatting and lint allowances across the crate, consolidating README.md emoji into component title text and removing separate emoji table cells for cleaner rendering\n- Mountain standardizes whitespace and formatting across Air client integration, application state DTOs, environment providers, IPC command handlers, extension management, and Cocoon gRPC service handlers (150+ files), and adds WorkingCopyDispatcher and WorkspaceDispatcher for WindServiceHandlers command routing\n- All other submodules advance with routine merge updates and mechanical formatting normalizations\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility; no functional modifications or breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "d411c769bb73d2f2964829cb1584a3ab77026e88"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-07T16:58:49Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⡏⠀⠀",
				27,
				14
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules with formatting normalization and README consolidation\n\nBatch update across all 14 Element submodules (Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Maintain, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Vine, Worker) synchronizing with upstream revisions.\n\nKey changes:\n- README header tables consolidated across Air, Cocoon, Echo, Grove, Mist, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Vine, and Worker — merging separate emoji/icon table cells into component name cells using Unicode em-space (&#x2001;) for consistent typographic spacing, reducing table column count while preserving visual presentation.\n- Whitespace and formatting normalization applied across Mountain (300+ files), Common (Transport/IPC modules), Echo (examples), Grove (source files), and Vine (27 notification handlers) — standardizing blank lines after type/impl definitions, import organization, dev_log! macro alignment, and lock acquisition patterns.\n- Dependency updates: actions/checkout bumped from 6.0.2 to 6.0.3 in Cocoon and Mist; protobumpjs updated from 8.5.0 to 8.6.0 in Cocoon.\n- Mountain introduces domain dispatchers in IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Dispatcher/ for 25+ command categories (configuration, encryption, extensions, filesystem, git, keybindings, language features, lifecycle, logging, menubar, model, navigation, native host, notifications, output, process, progress, quick input, search, sky, storage, terminal, text files, themes, tree views, updates, URLs, working copy, workspace) and adds UrlDispatcher stub.\n\nAll changes are mechanical formatting, whitespace, README layout, and dependency maintenance — no functional modifications or API breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "ada7d909ec5e7752161188c72c3ece583152a2d1"
		}
